ANALYSIS_MODE=demo
OPENAI_API_KEY=
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-6.1-sol
OPENAI_INTAKE_MODEL=gpt-6-luna
OPENAI_REASONING_EFFORT=low
AI_MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS=9000
AI_TIMEOUT_MS=90000
AI_INTAKE_TIMEOUT_MS=30000
# demo and explicit rule reference do not call a model or web search.
# AI_TIMEOUT_MS: 1000-90000; each final synthesis deadline (default 90000).
# Live v3: no-tools semantic planner <=25s, each web-search pass <=65s,
# then synthesis <=90s. If no suitable comparison is adopted and time remains,
# at most one additional search + synthesis pass reuses the validated plan.
# Shared analysis budget: 270s; /api/analyze maxDuration=300s; browser timeout=290s.
# Planner/search limits are code constants, not additional environment variables.
# No browser password or additional search-provider key is required.
# AI_INTAKE_TIMEOUT_MS: 1000-30000; default 30000; route=40s, browser=35s.
# OPENAI_REASONING_EFFORT controls synthesis: low/medium/high (default low).
# AI_MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS: 4000-16000 (default 9000); planner/search=3500, intake=4000.
# Full case data goes to no-tools planning and synthesis. Public search receives
# a screened abstract plan; heuristic screening is not a guarantee of anonymity.
